{
  "id": "E388",
  "title": "Get To Work",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-26",
  "synopsis": "In China, when young people talk about “carrying bricks”, they mean “to work hard”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50388/bc921cb400d6644169964256895263c32e30e201.mp3?1576959295",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我得去搬砖了\n\n小何：你还没回家啊！\n小张：我的报告还没写完。\n小何：明天再写吧，已经八点了。\n小张：不行，经理明天一早要看。不说了，我得去搬砖了。\n小何：好吧，我先回家了。你也别太晚了。\n",
    "traditional": "我得去搬磚了\n\n小何：你還沒回家啊！\n小張：我的報告還沒寫完。\n小何：明天再寫吧，已經八點了。\n小張：不行，經理明天一早要看。不說了，我得去搬磚了。\n小何：好吧，我先回家了。你也別太晚了。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Need To Get To Work"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：你还没回家啊！",
      "traditional": "小何：你還沒回家啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ hái méi huí jiā a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: You still haven’t returned home!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：我的报告还没写完。",
      "traditional": "小張：我的報告還沒寫完。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ de bào gào hái méi xiě wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I still haven’t finished writing my report."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：明天再写吧，已经八点了。",
      "traditional": "小何：明天再寫吧，已經八點了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé míng tiān zài xiě ba yǐ jīng bā diǎn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Write some more tomorrow, it’s already 8 o’clock."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：不行，经理明天一早要看。不说了，我得去搬砖了。",
      "traditional": "小張：不行，經理明天一早要看。不說了，我得去搬磚了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng bù xíng jīng lǐ míng tiān yì zǎo yào kàn bù shuō le wǒ děi qù bān zhuān le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: No, I can’t. The manager wants to see it tomorrow morning. I need to stop talking and get to work."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：好吧，我先回家了。你也别太晚了。",
      "traditional": "小何：好吧，我先回家了。你也別太晚了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo ba wǒ xiān huí jiā le nǐ yě bié tài wǎn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ok, I’ll go back home first. You also shouldn’t be too late."
    }
  ],
